  m_text: "\n<b><size=32><align=center><color=#003FFF>\nGAME OVER\n</b><size=28><align=left><color=#FFFFFF>\n\nA
    problem has been detected and SolsticeOS has been shut down to prevent damage
    to your machine. \n\nCheck to make sure any tape decks are fully inserted and
    vacume tubes are undamaged. If problems continue, disable or remove any newly
